.TH crisk-population 1  "population 0.2.0" 
.SH NAME
crisk\-population \- List the emergency population: merged changes carrying the emergency label in a window
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcrisk population\fR [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-policy\fR] [\fB\-\-base\fR] [\fB\-\-checkout\fR] [\fB\-\-gitlab\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fB\-\-since\fR> <\fB\-\-until\fR> <\fIFORGE\fR> <\fIREPOSITORY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the emergency population: merged changes carrying the emergency label in a window
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress status lines on stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
First day of the window, inclusive (YYYY\-MM\-DD, UTC)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
Last day of the window, inclusive (YYYY\-MM\-DD, UTC)
.TP
\fB\-\-policy\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
The policy file; without it, the policy is read from \-\-base of \-\-checkout
.TP
\fB\-\-base\fR \fI<REV>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-checkout\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]

.TP
\fB\-\-gitlab\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR [default: https://gitlab.com/api/v4]

.TP
\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 100]

.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write to FILE instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIFORGE\fR>
`github` or `gitlab`
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
github
.IP \(bu 2
gitlab
.RE
.TP
<\fIREPOSITORY\fR>
OWNER/REPO on GitHub, GROUP/PROJECT on GitLab
.SH VERSION
v0.2.0
